<title>CANADA: Patheon in C$12.5 mln shr offering.</title>
<headline>Patheon in C$12.5 mln shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patheon Inc said on Tuesday it agreed with underwriters for a public offering of 10 million common shares at C$1.25 a share for aggregate gross proceeds of C$12.5 million.</p>
<p>Patheon, Canada's largest independent provider of pharmaceutical manufacturing and packaging services, granted the underwriters an over-allotment option of 1.5 million common shares at the same price.</p>
<p>The offer is expected to close on November 7.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
